# Biome 1, level 12 — The Long Haul
#
# A corridor that turns at every single cell. Six conduits, every one of them a bend, and the length
# curve pays 448 for the whole run — more than four times what the first conduit is worth. This is
# the level that argues for length: there is no short answer here, only the long one.
#
# The two straights in the bag fit nowhere on a board this crooked, so they are what the skip tokens
# are for.

